<section class="music-studio studio-editorial content-view" data-studio aria-label="节奏实验室">
 <div class="studio-page-heading"><p>MUSIC / THE RHYTHM ROOM</p><span>写下节奏，让灵感有声。</span></div>
 <header class="studio-mast studio-illustrated"><img class="studio-soundcheck" src="<%= url_for(theme.nijika.studio_art) %>" srcset="<%= nijika_art_srcset(theme.nijika.studio_art) %>" sizes="(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 75vw" decoding="async" alt="虹夏在暖金舞台上演奏鼓组的精绘主题同人插画" width="1916" height="821"><div class="studio-mast-copy"><p class="studio-eyebrow">CC ATELIER · SOUND EXPLORATIONS</p><h1 tabindex="-1">节奏实验室</h1><p class="studio-mast-deck">从一拍开始，<br>到一场属于你的现场。</p><button type="button" class="livehouse-open" data-live-open hidden>进入现场 <span aria-hidden="true"><%- partial('nijika/editorial-arrow') %></span></button><span class="studio-hero-caption">互动鼓组 / 灯光编排 / 灵感录制</span></div><a href="<%= url_for('atelier/') %>">返回后台 ↗</a></header>
 <div class="studio-introduction">
  <div class="studio-intro-copy"><span class="studio-section-index">01 / FIND YOUR GROOVE</span><h2>先找到你的律动。</h2><p>选择一个起点，在下方编排六种鼓声。每一格都是一个十六分音符；点击可切换强拍、轻拍与留白。</p><a href="#rhythm-desk">打开编曲台 ↓</a></div>
  <a class="studio-practice-link" href="<%= url_for('studio/practice/') %>"><span class="studio-practice-index">02 / PRACTICE ROOM</span><strong>把灵感练成默契。</strong><span>鼓谱排练室 · 跟谱、慢练、小节循环</span><span class="studio-practice-staff" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class="studio-practice-action">前往排练 <%- partial('nijika/editorial-arrow') %></span></a>
 </div>
 <section class="studio-starters" aria-labelledby="studio-starters-title"><div class="studio-section-heading"><h2 id="studio-starters-title">三个节奏起点</h2><span>仅载入编排，按下播放才会发声。</span></div><div class="studio-starter-grid">
 <% for (const [key,no,title,caption,tempo] of [['indie','01','放学后的排练','清晰的底鼓，留给旋律的空间。','112 BPM'],['halftime','02','慢半拍','把重心放慢，听见节拍的呼吸。','86 BPM'],['blank','03','空白录音带','留一页空白，写下自己的节奏。','YOUR FIRST BEAT']]) { %>
 <button type="button" class="studio-starter" data-studio-starter="<%= key %>" disabled><span class="studio-starter-meta"><span><%= no %> / <%= tempo %></span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span><strong><%= title %></strong><span class="studio-starter-description"><%= caption %></span><span class="studio-starter-pattern" data-starter-pattern aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="studio-starter-action">载入编曲台</span></button>
 <% } %>
 </div><p class="studio-starter-status" data-starter-status role="status">示例由浏览器合成鼓声，不使用歌曲音源。</p></section>
 <div class="studio-desk-heading" id="rhythm-desk"><div><span class="studio-section-index">03 / MAKE IT YOURS</span><h2>你的节奏，正在成形。</h2></div><p data-studio-overview>6 声部 · 16 步进 · 可导出 WAV</p></div>
 <noscript><p>节奏实验室需要 JavaScript。你仍可前往<a href="<%= url_for('notes/') %>">笔记档案</a>阅读。</p></noscript>
 <div class="studio-console" hidden aria-label="节奏编曲台">
  <div class="studio-top"><label class="studio-project-name">TAPE / <input data-project-name maxlength="60" aria-label="项目名称" value="放学后的排练"></label><span class="studio-live-indicator"><i></i><b data-studio-mode>STANDBY</b></span><button class="lighting-open">调光台 ↗</button></div>
  <div class="studio-monitor"><div class="studio-monitor-title"><span>MASTER / OUTPUT</span><strong data-step-display>—<small>/16</small></strong><span data-studio-time>等待你的第一拍</span></div><canvas data-audio-scope aria-label="实时音频波形与频谱"></canvas><div class="studio-monitor-level"><span>LEVEL</span><div><i data-master-level></i></div><span>−∞ → 0</span></div></div>
  <div class="studio-transport"><button data-studio-play class="studio-play" aria-pressed="false">▶ 播放</button><button data-studio-stop aria-label="停止播放">■</button><label class="studio-tempo">BPM<input data-bpm type="number" min="60" max="180" value="112"></label><button data-studio-tap>TAP</button><label>摆动 <input data-swing type="range" min="0" max="60" value="0"><output data-swing-output>0%</output></label><label>总音量<input data-master type="range" min="0" max="100" value="65"></label><label>步数<select data-step-count><option value="16">16 STEPS</option><option value="32">32 STEPS</option></select></label></div>
  <div class="studio-pattern-bar"><span>SEQUENCER / 点击切换音符力度</span><div><button data-studio-undo aria-label="撤销">↶</button><button data-studio-redo aria-label="重做">↷</button><label>载入预设 <select data-studio-preset><option value="" selected>选择起点…</option><option value="indie">放学后的排练</option><option value="halftime">慢半拍</option><option value="blank">空白录音带</option></select></label></div></div>
  <div class="studio-sequencer-scroll"><div data-sequencer class="studio-sequencer"></div></div>
  <div class="studio-key"><span><i></i>强拍</span><span><i class="soft"></i>轻拍</span><span>空格 播放 / 停止</span><span>A S D F G H 即兴敲击</span><span>方向键移动音符焦点</span></div>
  <div class="studio-bottom"><div><h2>导出作品</h2><p data-studio-status role="status">声音由浏览器实时合成，不会自动播放。</p></div><div class="studio-export"><div><button data-studio-save>保存项目</button><button data-studio-load>载入项目</button><button data-project-export>导出 JSON</button><label class="studio-import">导入 JSON<input data-project-import type="file" accept=".json,application/json"></label></div><div><label>录制长度<select data-export-loops><option value="1">1 轮</option><option value="2" selected>2 轮</option><option value="4">4 轮</option></select></label><button data-wav-export class="studio-wav">⇩ 导出立体声 WAV</button></div></div></div>
 </div>
 <p class="studio-footnote">离开页面或切换到后台时，演奏会停止。戴上耳机，从小音量开始。</p>
</section>
